KiLens

KiLens is a Visual Studio Code extension for previewing KiCad schematic and
PCB files with KiCanvas.

KiLens is based on KiCode by Sajad Ghorbani.

Original work copyright (c) 2025 Sajad Ghorbani.
Modifications copyright (c) 2026 fleaxiao.

